# Anchored to the repository root: these are the layout a root-level virtualenv creates, per the
# comment at the top of this file. Unanchored they matched at any depth, and since git sets
# core.ignorecase on macOS and Windows, `Scripts/` also swallowed `.github/scripts/` there while
# tracking it normally on Linux -- a file present in CI but invisible on the author's machine.
/Lib/
/Scripts/
dist/

__pycache__/

